INT. HOLLOWAY FERTILITY CLINIC - CONSULT ROOM - DAY

ON CAMERA: handheld, a crew of one. A consult room, beige, a poster of a cross-section nobody asked for. Dana, 30s, sits on the exam bench with a paper gown over her jeans, thumbs hovering over her phone. Dr. Imran Haq, 50s, tablet in hand, takes the stool in front of her.

DR. HAQ
Dana, before we start, you're fine with the camera?

DANA
Wes thinks it's a bad idea. Wes thinks everything is a bad idea this month.

DR. HAQ
Understood. We can stop at any point.

Dana's phone buzzes. We see the screen.

ON PHONE: where r u

ON PHONE: is it done yet

ON PHONE: call me

DANA
He's in the parking lot. He wouldn't come in.

DR. HAQ
Would you like to call him?

DANA
(beat)
Put him on speaker. Maybe he'll listen to you.

She dials. It rings twice.

WES (V.O.)
Hey. Hey. Is the doctor there? Can he hear me?

DR. HAQ
I can hear you, Wes. I'm going to share the results with Dana, and I'd like you to hear them too.

WES (V.O.)
Fine. Just say it fast.

DR. HAQ
The third cycle did not take. I'm sorry.

DANA
It's fine.

WES (V.O.)
It's not fine, Dana.

DANA
(smiling, brittle)
It's fine, Wes.

Dr. Haq glances at the camera, then away.

DR. HAQ
There is a fourth option. A different protocol. But you should know the odds are lower, and the cost is not small, and I would never push you either way.

DANA
You're not pushing.

WES (V.O.)
You are pushing, though, kind of, I mean the whole place is a push.

DANA
Wes, I'm going to hang up now.

DR. HAQ
Dana, take a moment.

DANA
I don't need a moment. I need him to stop talking.

WES (V.O.)
I'm just saying we already spent

DANA
I know what we spent.

She ends the call. Silence. The poster hums its bright pink hum. Dana looks into the lens for the first time.

DANA (CONT'D)
You can put that in the film.

DR. HAQ
Let's talk about the fourth option.

DANA
Okay.

Her phone buzzes once more. She does not look. A new message sits on the dark screen.

ON PHONE: sorry. im coming in
